# What Nextflow leaves behind when a run is launched from inside the repo.
# Easy to do while testing nf-tui on itself, and `git add -A` will take all of
# it: 492 files and 52 MB the one time it happened. The work tree is also full
# of symlinks into a work dir that no longer exists, which is what broke the
# GitHub Pages build.
